eloping that  character  and and you know handling that character  yeah it's one of the things that i live  for in filmmaking i love  bigness and i love big emotions but  filling them  in with details that ground them is the  fun of the sport  you know even when i made monster it was  kind of the thrill of like  sinking into a story and really trying  to understand what that would feel like  to go through  and and give empathy to it and then same  thing with wonder woman  same thing with max lord who's your  villain i love  kind of trying to to track all of those  things with human  dynamics that we all understand so yeah  it was such a brave performance of  pedro's because you got to be  out there there's no safety net he'd  never  done anything like it before and but he  also brought so much humanity to it i'm  so  so happy he's getting celebrated the way  he is and kristen too  yeah absolutely well patty thank you so  much for chatting it was lovely to see  you and congratulations on the movie  great to see you thank you take care  this is a lot of fun  and uh happy holidays thank you happy  holidays stay safe  well thank you so much kristen excellent  work in the movie it's really great and  you're wonderful and i think the fans  are going to be very happy  okay okay well thank you so much gail  happy hanukkah  happy hanukkah thank you so much

